---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: MIDI Mob Collective
description: MIDI Mob Collective — Birmingham's collaborative music community. Producers, musicians, and sonic experimenters spanning psytrance to folk, ambient to experimental rock.
navCollective: true
permalink: /collective.html
---

<!-- 01 HERO / INTRO -->
<section class="section" style="background: var(--bg-dark); padding-top: calc(var(--space-section) + 1rem);">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section__eyebrow" style="color: var(--accent-cold);">01 · COLLECTIVE</p>
    <h1 class="section__title section__title--cold">MIDI Mob</h1>
    <p class="section__body">
      MIDI Mob Collective is a Birmingham-based music community bringing together producers,
      musicians, and sonic experimenters. Spanning genres from psytrance to folk, ambient to
      experimental rock, the collective is united by a love of hardware, vinyl, and the creative process.
    </p>
    <div class="coordinates" style="margin-top: var(--space-block);">
      <div class="coord"><span class="coord__label">LOCATION</span><span class="coord__value">BIRMINGHAM AL</span></div>
      <div class="coord"><span class="coord__label">FOUNDED</span><span class="coord__value">1999</span></div>
      <div class="coord"><span class="coord__label">SIGNAL</span><span class="coord__value">MIDI MOB</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 02 MEMBERS -->
<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section__eyebrow">02 · MEMBERS</p>
    <h2 class="section__title">The Artists</h2>
    <p class="section__body">The producers, musicians, and collaborators making it happen.</p>
    <div class="members-grid" style="margin-top: var(--space-block);">
      {% for member in collective.members %}
        {% include "partials/member-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 03 EVENTS -->
<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section__eyebrow" style="color: var(--accent-cold);">03 · EVENTS</p>
    <h2 class="section__title section__title--cold">Live Gatherings</h2>
    <p class="section__body">
      Moments from our live events, jam sessions, and collective gatherings across Birmingham.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: var(--space-block);">
      <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-primary); padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-block);">
        <p class="section__eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">NOVEMBER 1ST, 2025</p>
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--type-h2); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Day of the Dead Vape Loft Street Jam
        </h3>
        <p class="section__body">
          A full day and night of modular synthesis, live electronic improvisation, and collaborative
          jamming at Vape Loft in Lakeview. Artists including Will, Whoopsie, Xalpheric, So So,
          Noah Richardson, and more brought their hardware to the street — Prophet synths, modular
          rigs, drum machines, and endless patch cables under colorful LED-lit tents.
        </p>
        <div class="photo-grid" style="margin-top: var(--space-block); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 0.5rem;">
          {% for i in range(1, 24) %}
          <img
            src="/assets/midimob{{ i }}.jpg"
            alt="Day of the Dead event — MIDI Mob {{ i }}"
            loading="lazy"
            style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); transition: var(--transition-glide);"
          >
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 04 CONTACT -->
<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section__eyebrow">04 · CONNECT</p>
    <h2 class="section__title">Get Involved</h2>
    <p class="section__body">
      MIDI Mob Collective is always open to new collaborators and sonic adventurers.
      Reach out to connect with the community.
    </p>
    <div style="margin-top: var(--space-block); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;">
      <a href="mailto:xalpheric@proton.me" class="glide-btn">Contact Xalpheric</a>
      <a href="/index.html" class="glide-btn glide-btn--cold">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
